Description: Provides an R-native, release-aware interface to the Allen Brain
    Cell (ABC) Atlas <https://brain-map.org/bkp/explore/abc-atlas>.
    Discovers supported dataset routes, assembles validated cell and gene
    metadata, reports the expression files and disk space a request needs,
    and reads the expression of selected cells and genes from H5AD files
    directly in R. Expression can be returned as a sparse matrix bundle, a
    SingleCellExperiment, or a SpatialExperiment object. The package
    preserves source representation and provenance and distinguishes raw
    counts from upstream transformed or imputed expression. Atlas files are
    downloaded on first use and cached locally, so an internet connection is
    needed the first time each file is accessed.
